<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Razor">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
		<ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<Version>4.0.0-preview.15</Version>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>FIX LFM2 (and any add_bos_token=true ChatML model) degenerate chat output: the ChatML prompt path never prepended the model's BOS, so LFM2's required &lt;|startoftext|&gt; (id 1) was dropped, putting the model off its training distribution (coherent for a token or two, then garbage). ChatTemplates.BuildChatPrompt now honors the GGUF's tokenizer.ggml.add_bos_token on the ChatML path (qwen2.5/qwen3 stay BOS-less; unaffected). Verified: LFM2 answers coherently. Also carries preview.14: three new GGUF LLM architectures qwen3, LFM2, and qwen3.5 (Qwen3-Next). qwen3 adds the useRMSNorm path (standard transformer). LFM2 is a ShortConv hybrid with a conv-state cache for O(1) KV-decode. qwen3.5 (GGUF arch qwen35) is Gated DeltaNet linear-attention (24 layers) + gated full-attention (8 layers): the GatedDeltaNet op is bit-exact to an independent numpy reference and the full model predicts " Paris" for "The capital of France is" (residual bit-exact through 4 layers on CUDA). qwen3 + LFM2 are verified end-to-end on WebGPU + WebGL + CUDA + OpenCL. Carries preview.13 (SD-Turbo VAE full-res GPU-resident). Full changelog: https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
		<GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
		<EmbedAllSources>true</EmbedAllSources>
		<DebugType>Embedded</DebugType>
		<Title>SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML</Title>
		<Authors>LostBeard</Authors>
		<Description>Hardware-agnostic machine learning infrastructure for .NET. Implements high-performance neural network layers in C# that transpile to WebGPU, CUDA, OpenCL, and WebGL via SpawnDev.ILGPU. Optimized for Blazor WebAssembly and native GPU execution.</Description>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML</PackageProjectUrl>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
		<PackageIcon>icon-128.png</PackageIcon>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML.git</RepositoryUrl>
		<RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
		<PackageTags>Blazor;BlazorWebAssembly;WebGPU;WebGL;WebAssembly;WebWorkers;GPGPU;ILGPU;ParallelProcessing;Cuda;OpenCL;ComputeShader;CrossPlatform;MachineLearning</PackageTags>
		<NoPackageAnalysis>true</NoPackageAnalysis>
		<EnableDefaultCompileItems>true</EnableDefaultCompileItems>
		<IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
		<LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
		<AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web" Version="10.0.4" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<None Include="Assets\icon-128.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\LICENSE.txt" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="wwwroot\icon-128.png" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="SpawnDev.BlazorJS" Version="3.5.25" />
		<PackageReference Include="SpawnDev.ILGPU" Version="4.17.6" />
		<PackageReference Include="SpawnDev.WebTorrent" Version="3.2.12" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<SupportedPlatform Include="browser" />
		<SupportedPlatform Include="windows" />
		<SupportedPlatform Include="linux" />
		<SupportedPlatform Include="macos" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<EmbeddedResource Include="Data\imagenet_classes.txt" />
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
